{
  "PostToolUse": [
    {
      "matcher": "Write|Edit",
      "hooks": [
        {
          "type": "prompt",
          "prompt": "If working in a skill directory (path contains '/skills/'), verify:\n\n1. **History Logging:** If a skill was used, check that History/{YYYY-MM-DD}.md was updated with:\n   - Format: '## HH:MM - Action Taken'\n   - One-line summary included\n   - Timestamp accurate\n\n2. **Version Management:** If SKILL.md was modified:\n   - Version number incremented (V1.X format)\n   - Frontmatter valid\n   - Description updated if needed\n\n3. **Standards Compliance:**\n   - All 'ALWAYS:' sections from the skill were followed\n   - skill-improver standards met\n   - Linting considerations noted\n\nProvide specific feedback on any missing items. If everything looks good, acknowledge completion."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "Stop": [
    {
      "matcher": "*",
      "hooks": [
        {
          "type": "prompt",
          "prompt": "Before stopping, perform final skills repository check:\n\n1. **History Logged?** If a skill was used, verify History/{YYYY-MM-DD}.md entry exists\n\n2. **Version Bumped?** If SKILL.md was modified, verify version incremented\n\n3. **Linting Status?** If PowerShell or Markdown files modified, note if linting passed\n\n4. **Git Status?** Check if changes are staged or if working tree is clean\n\n5. **Retrospective Done?** If skill was modified, verify retrospective check completed\n\nReturn JSON:\n- {\"decision\": \"approve\"} if all checks pass\n- {\"decision\": \"block\", \"reason\": \"Missing: [specific items]\"} if anything is missing\n\nInclude a systemMessage with details."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
